<p>You built parts of your life together. The devices, accounts and services you shared may still connect you, even when you want more space and privacy.</p>
<p>Dr. Lior Tabansky works with you, in person, to understand what remains connected and help you decide what to change. You do not have to untangle the technical details before asking for help.</p>
<p><a class="btn" href="#contact">Request a private conversation</a></p>
