<section class="copy-section" id="you-decide-what-is-changed-and-shared" aria-labelledby="you-decide-what-is-changed-and-shared-heading"><div class="wrap copy-body"><h2 id="you-decide-what-is-changed-and-shared-heading">You decide what is changed and shared</h2>
<p>You remain present, approve material changes and control your credentials. Toza does not keep them for ongoing use, remotely control your devices, monitor them or install security software on them.</p>
<p>With your authorization, an attorney-friendly summary can explain the work and remaining issues, and we can coordinate with counsel. We do not investigate your spouse, reconstruct events forensically, collect legal evidence or give legal advice. The summary is not a forensic report or a guarantee that no exposure remains.</p>
