<section class="copy-section copy-contact" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-heading"><div class="wrap copy-body"><h2 id="contact-heading">Start with what is on your mind.</h2>
<p>You do not need to explain the whole situation in a first message. Send a short, neutral WhatsApp or Signal message. Dr. Tabansky replies personally as soon as possible. The first conversation checks fit and urgency; it includes no device inspection, mapping, diagnosis or technical work. Contacting Toza does not commit you to purchase.</p>
<p>If the service fits, you receive a written scope and price. The paid visit is scheduled after your explicit acceptance and receipt of payment.</p>
